{"4121220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kosenki", "steam_appid": 4121220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/810c798a453254999c4859d0f2cca0f3.poster.avif?t=1783043418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/810c798a453254999c4859d0f2cca0f3.webm?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/810c798a453254999c4859d0f2cca0f3.mp4?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Kosenki</i></strong> is a single player dark fantasy hack and slash with stylish combat, where precision, speed, and mastery define every battle. Easy to learn. Hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across a war-torn continent powered by the mysterious mineral known as Kosenki.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Hayato, a broken samurai seeking peace in a world that no longer remembers it, and face enemies both on the battlefield and within his own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure the war within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/420a956a1fdf546641071f458d214320.avif?t=1783043418\" width=559 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with speed, precision, and style. Your skill is the only limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link katana and energy-fist attacks into relentless combo chains, mixing charged strikes, power-up states, grabbing and launching enemies, brutal finishers, devastating special attacks, perfectly timed parries and dashes, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/c98e9fcd213eb05e8ef16f02271f12ea.poster.avif?t=1783043418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/c98e9fcd213eb05e8ef16f02271f12ea.webm?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/c98e9fcd213eb05e8ef16f02271f12ea.mp4?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weaponize the environment itself: break pillars, smash enemies through obstacles, and turn the arena against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/0bd7157a97ac3cf64742dbb8c86699cf.poster.avif?t=1783043418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/0bd7157a97ac3cf64742dbb8c86699cf.webm?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/0bd7157a97ac3cf64742dbb8c86699cf.mp4?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/bf9705daa3ab274376ab466eec23eef1.avif?t=1783043418\" width=559 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across a continent divided into three warring nations, a fragile balance endured for centuries; until the discovery of Kosenki, a powerful mineral that propelled technology forward, and accelerated conflict even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Hayato, a battle-worn samurai haunted by the ghosts of his past. Once driven by honor and revenge, he now seeks peace in a world that no longer remembers it…  His journey unfolds not only across battlefields, but through trauma, guilt, and memory, as he confronts rival nations and the darkness growing within his own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/d0ca00657e471f07c35a191aa1868c96.poster.avif?t=1783043418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/d0ca00657e471f07c35a191aa1868c96.webm?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/d0ca00657e471f07c35a191aa1868c96.mp4?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through Hayato’s journey, the story explores the true cost of war: the loss of loved ones, addiction, and the lasting psychological scars it leaves behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A war outside. A war within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/78e3f0cb412610c10dfd06b9597ff682.poster.avif?t=1783043418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/78e3f0cb412610c10dfd06b9597ff682.webm?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/78e3f0cb412610c10dfd06b9597ff682.mp4?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/c48986ff8b6ac2066d119000626b3d76.avif?t=1783043418\" width=559 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world rewards those who wander and observe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden routes, treasure chests, rare loot, and crystal deposits off the beaten path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/72f3cf95e7df6aa3e3c410c348c98c41.poster.avif?t=1783043418\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/72f3cf95e7df6aa3e3c410c348c98c41.webm?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/72f3cf95e7df6aa3e3c410c348c98c41.mp4?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash across pits, avoid falling hazards, and survive dangerous environments where precision movement is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/2f4ca35d3fdcd41afe0ab7a0b246d4c7.poster.avif?t=1783043418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/2f4ca35d3fdcd41afe0ab7a0b246d4c7.webm?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/2f4ca35d3fdcd41afe0ab7a0b246d4c7.mp4?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/6729a03bca0ee6381a44efe5acd04248.avif?t=1783043418\" width=559 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge a style that feels like your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new combos, powerful upgrades, combat skills, and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/8724837de984e1b7fa48d37894dceb4c.poster.avif?t=1783043418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/8724837de984e1b7fa48d37894dceb4c.webm?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/8724837de984e1b7fa48d37894dceb4c.mp4?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build to cover weaknesses or push your strengths even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.s