21220/extras/3124724d4ccb351c8dd9d492fa359dc0.webm?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/3124724d4ccb351c8dd9d492fa359dc0.mp4?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/ca64a0a6b49a76ee2108779d3d2493b8.avif?t=1783043418\" width=559 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through multiple handcrafted levels and face powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a wide variety of enemies across distinct locations and biomes throughout the continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets, overcome challenges, and master every encounter that stands in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/e38cddafb9a66f2fbabac9a0042d8fe0.poster.avif?t=1783043418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/e38cddafb9a66f2fbabac9a0042d8fe0.webm?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/extras/e38cddafb9a66f2fbabac9a0042d8fe0.mp4?t=1783043418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Kosenki is a fast-paced, stylish combat game set in a dark techno-feudal world. Master creative, high-speed battles as Hayato, a broken samurai fighting enemies from a Kosenki-corrupted world, and his own inner demons.", "supported_languages": "English, Spa